    <bpmn:process id="W_W3517" name="W3517. Freight Budget, Forecast &amp; Variance Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget (links to VS-33.1); monthly close
Frequency: Annual + monthly
Volume: Group freight budget
Owner: FP&amp;A / Logistics
Participants: FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4/VS-33.1), Logistics (links to VS-06), Treasury (links to VS-18), Merchandising (links to VS-01/VS-101), Supply Planning (links to VS-02)
Source: workflow W3517 — Freight Budget, Forecast &amp; Variance Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3517_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3517_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A">
