      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3517_Start3" name="Annual budget (links to VS-33.1); monthly close">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3517_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3517_Task4" name="FP&amp;A/Logistics build the annual freight budget: by leg/carrier/lane/entity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: FP&amp;A/Logistics build the annual freight budget: by leg/carrier/lane/entity, driven by the sales/S&amp;OP plan (links to VS-33.1/VS-02.1), import volume (links to VS-02.2), network/store-growth (links to VS-37/VS-04), fuel/commodity outlook (links to VS-106/VS-61/W3519), and rate plans (W3499); set the baseline and contingencies
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / Logistics
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3517_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3517_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3517_Task5" name="FP&amp;A/Logistics forecast and track monthly: actual vs budget freight spend by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FP&amp;A/Logistics forecast and track monthly: actual vs budget freight spend by leg/carrier/lane, volume/rate/fuel drivers, and variance; identify root cause (volume mix, rate change, accessorial, off-guide, fuel) and corrective action
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / Logistics
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3517_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3517_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3517_Task6" name="FP&amp;A/Logistics report freight variance to executives (links to VS-33.2) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: FP&amp;A/Logistics report freight variance to executives (links to VS-33.2) and governance (W3520), re-forecast the full-year freight, and feed variance insights to the reduction program (W3518), budget cycle (links to VS-33.1), and carrier sourcing (W3497)
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / Logistics
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly/quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3517_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3517_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3517_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3517_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
