    <bpmn:process id="W_W3518" name="W3518. Freight Cost Reduction &amp; Continuous Improvement Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Targets (W3497); analytics (W3516); QBR (W3512)
Frequency: Continuous + quarterly
Volume: Program-wide
Owner: Logistics / Procurement
Participants: Logistics (links to VS-06), Procurement (links to VS-03/VS-34), FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Supply Planning (links to VS-02), IT (links to VS-27/VS-30), Innovation (links to VS-30)
Source: workflow W3518 — Freight Cost Reduction &amp; Continuous Improvement Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3518_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3518_Lane1" name="Logistics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3518_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3518_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3518_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3518_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3518_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3518_Start3" name="Targets (W3497); analytics (W3516); QBR (W3512)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3518_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3518_Task4" name="Logistics/Procurement maintain the freight cost-reduction pipeline…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Logistics/Procurement maintain the freight cost-reduction pipeline: opportunities from spend analytics (W3497/W3516), carrier consolidation/rationalization, mode-shift (e.g., RORO vs air for urgent), load consolidation (W3507), backhaul utilization, network redesign (links to VS-04), packaging/cube optimization (links to VS-111/W3541), and technology/automation (links to VS-30/VS-27 Oracle Transportation Execution)
Responsible (R): Logistics / Procurement
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3518_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3518_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3518_Task5" name="Logistics execute the opportunities: business case, sponsor/approval (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Logistics execute the opportunities: business case, sponsor/approval (links to VS-40 where capex), implementation, and benefit tracking vs baseline (W3497); manage cross-functional initiatives (network, packaging, IT) via the PMO (links to VS-112)
Responsible (R): Logistics / PMO
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3518_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3518_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3518_Task6" name="Logistics/FP&amp;A track realized savings vs target and re-baseline the spend…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Logistics/FP&amp;A track realized savings vs target and re-baseline the spend (W3497), publish the reduction-program performance to executives (links to VS-33.2) and governance (W3520), and feed continuous improvement/lessons to sourcing (W3498) and operations (links to VS-21 audit)
Responsible (R): Logistics / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3518_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3518_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3518_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3518_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
