        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-561 (ensure controlled execution — Freight Audit, Payment &amp; Freight Cost Analytics (PA-110.3).) | - operational: re-baselining and tracking; operational: continuous ideation and analytics
Owner: Logistics / Procurement</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
