    <bpmn:process id="W_W3519" name="W3519. Fuel Surcharge, Index Management &amp; Freight Rate Volatility" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Fuel-price change; contract cycle (W3499); commodity outlook (links to VS-106)
Frequency: Continuous + periodic adjustment
Volume: All fuel-surcharge/index-linked contracts
Owner: Logistics / Finance
Participants: Logistics (links to VS-06/VS-61), Finance/FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), Treasury (links to VS-18), Procurement (links to VS-03), Carrier
Source: workflow W3519 — Fuel Surcharge, Index Management &amp; Freight Rate Volatility</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3519_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3519_Lane1" name="Logistics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3519_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3519_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3519_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3519_Lane2" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3519_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3519_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3519_Start4" name="Fuel-price change; contract cycle (W3499); commodity outlook (links to VS-106)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3519_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3519_Task5" name="Logistics/Procurement manage fuel-surcharge and index clauses in carrier…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Logistics/Procurement manage fuel-surcharge and index clauses in carrier contracts (W3499): formula (DOE/industry fuel index), adjustment frequency/cap/floor, pass-through vs shared, and commodity-index links where relevant (steel/cement links to VS-106); negotiate balanced mechanisms
Responsible (R): Logistics / Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3519_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3519_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3519_Task6" name="Logistics/Finance track fuel/rate volatility impact (links to W1440/W1166)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Logistics/Finance track fuel/rate volatility impact (links to W1440/W1166): monitor the fuel index, compute surcharge impact on freight cost, forecast the budget impact (W3517), and trigger rate/routing actions to absorb volatility; hedge where policy permits (links to VS-18.3/VS-106)
Responsible (R): Logistics / Finance / Treasury
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager / CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3519_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3519_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3519_Task7" name="Finance/Logistics report fuel/rate-volatility impact and hedging outcome to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/Logistics report fuel/rate-volatility impact and hedging outcome to executives (links to VS-33.2) and governance (W3520), validate the surcharge in freight audit (W3513), and feed rate-volatility insights to contract negotiation (W3499) and commodity risk (links to VS-106)
Responsible (R): Finance / Logistics
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3519_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3519_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
