    <bpmn:process id="W_W3520" name="W3520. Freight Risk, Insurance &amp; Business Continuity" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual risk review (links to VS-21.2); BCP cycle (links to VS-26); disruption event (links to VS-69)
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: Program-wide
Owner: Logistics / Risk
Participants: Logistics (links to VS-06), Risk (links to VS-21.2), Insurance (links to VS-26), BCP (links to VS-26.1), Compliance (links to VS-22), Procurement (links to VS-03), Finance (links to VS-17)
Source: workflow W3520 — Freight Risk, Insurance &amp; Business Continuity</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3520_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3520_Lane1" name="Logistics">
