        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3520_Start5" name="Annual risk review (links to VS-21.2); BCP cycle (links to VS-26); disruption event…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3520_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3520_Task6" name="Logistics/Risk maintain the freight-risk view: carrier concentration and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Logistics/Risk maintain the freight-risk view: carrier concentration and financial-distress risk, capacity/space risk (peak/typhoon links to VS-69), port/congestion risk, fuel/price risk (W3519), cargo loss/damage risk (W3511), regulatory/customs risk (links to VS-22/VS-87), cyber risk (Oracle Transportation Execution/track links to VS-27.3), and counterparty risk; integrate to ERM (links to VS-21.2)
Responsible (R): Logistics / Risk
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3520_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3520_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3520_Task7" name="Insurance/Risk ensure adequate cargo/marine/transit and carrier-liability…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Insurance/Risk ensure adequate cargo/marine/transit and carrier-liability coverage (links to VS-26.3/W59), set deductibles/limits, manage the claims process (W3511), and review annually; align to group insurance (links to VS-26)
Responsible (R): Insurance / Risk / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3520_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3520_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3520_Task8" name="BCP/Logistics maintain freight business continuity: alternate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: BCP/Logistics maintain freight business continuity: alternate carriers/lanes/modes, port diversification, island BCP (links to VS-69/VS-26), inventory safety stock (links to VS-02/VS-05), and crisis response; report freight risk/BCP to executives (links to VS-33.2) and risk/audit committee (links to VS-36/VS-21)
Responsible (R): BCP / Logistics / Risk
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual + event-driven</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3520_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3520_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3520_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3520_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
